                <h1 class="case-study-title">Mosafir Travel Booking Platform for Scalable Tourism Operations</h1>
                <p class="hero-lead">Built a production travel platform that connected package discovery, reservations, payments, and operator workflows inside one scalable Laravel system.</p>
