                <div class="project-media">
                  <img src="/assets/img/projects/mosafir/feature.webp" alt="Mosafir Travel Booking Platform for Scalable Tourism Operations main project preview" width="1600" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card card-primary">
                  <span class="eyebrow">Booking Ops</span>
                  <strong>Trip discovery, reservation sync, and operator updates stayed aligned across high-intent traveler journeys.</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
