            <article class="stat-card"><strong>3.1x</strong><span>Faster package discovery after search and content optimization</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong>-37%</strong><span>Manual booking coordination for operators and support teams</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong>99.95%</strong><span>Reservation workflow uptime across payment and confirmation events</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong>50k+</strong><span>Monthly traveler sessions supported during seasonal demand spikes</span></article>
